stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> StateClosed: constructor initializes generation
StateClosed --> StateClosed: expired interval observed / clear counts and advance generation
StateClosed --> StateOpen: current failure trips policy
StateOpen --> StateHalfOpen: State or stale completion first observes expiry
StateOpen --> StateHalfOpenSaturated: expired admission takes sole slot
StateHalfOpen --> StateHalfOpenSaturated: admission takes final slot
StateHalfOpen --> StateClosed: repeated success on same callback reaches threshold
StateHalfOpen --> StateOpen: current failure
StateHalfOpenSaturated --> StateClosed: current success reaches threshold
StateHalfOpenSaturated --> StateOpen: current failure
note right of StateHalfOpenSaturated
Admission budget is per generation.
Missing reports leave the budget consumed.
end note
note left of StateClosed
The constructor establishes the initial generation.
State, admission and accounting reconcile the clock.
Name and Counts do not reconcile time.
end note
note right of StateOpen
Work admitted in older generations can still run.
Its accounting is discarded after time reconciliation.
end note
